      "id": "IR107-01",
      "priority": "P2",
      "line": 38,
      "problem": "Root and mirror may use one identical receipt+three-pointer observation tuple. Relative inputs pass for both bases, so one Root observation can be counted twice as dual-side provenance.",
      "counterexample": {
        "file": "probe107.json",
        "rawBytesSha256": "775137e03e31ddaa8d63f23473ef06ec00908ee754740f1d73b4f27ba5c0387c"
      },
      "fix": "Reject reuse of the same observation tuple; retain explicit side identity/source root in each actual observation. A combined receipt may remain supported if it contains distinct side-specific observations. Do not solve this merely by renaming the same receipt."
    }
